QSTR2lbw&oe=6B04660E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TableOfTales_CoverImage_Video.png", "id": "527498059052597", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974522_527498062385930_8535412789414279458_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nCSI6TLqHEgQ7kNvwE9xDFj&_nc_oc=AdqPTjfVHyCsAmcQHbjyHNI__uiUdHyLnq77j17tHZhViqQUPlqMt5FUQtLSIH1HiMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTTxm4WeUJUcgMcfmaRxGtBoKJ5CVM-LvqX_Cwm0FwVqg&oe=6B0479C6"}, "display_name": "Table of Tales: The Crooked Crown", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Embark on a single-player narrative-driven campaign featuring a fully-voiced Dungeon Master companion, who appears as a mechanical talking bird called Arbitrix.\n- Guide a party of four scoundrels through a captivating story that is shaped by important world-changing choices!\n- High Replayability. No one playthrough is the same as another based on critical choices you make on the way, including throwing your scoundrels overboard!\n- Use powerful magic, battle, charm or sneak your way through more than 24 enthralling encounters.\n- Tactical turn-based combat and encounters feature dice, cards, skill checks and over 40 different types of enemy.\n- Each scoundrel has their own skill and stat upgrade path. Choose different abilities or magic each time you play.\n- The magical table transforms before your eyes. You need to see it to believe it!\n- Use controllers or your hands to interact with the figurines and cards.", "short_description": "Table of Tales: The Crooked Crown is a role playing adventure that brings tabletop gaming to life with animated miniatures, dice-rolling, and card-based abilities and magic. Take a seat at the magical table, captain the helm, and lead your party of scoundrels as they venture through a world of swashbuckling and sorcery."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tinmangam